#Indentation error -> indentation missing or inconsistent
#NameError -> variable or function name doesn't exist
#TypeError -> operation receives an incompatible type
#ValueError -> type is acceptable but value is invalid
#IndexError -> sequence index is outside its valid range
#KeyError -> dictionary does not contain requested key
#AttributeError -> object does not have requested attribute or method
#FileNotFoundError or ModuleNoteFoundError -> Python can't find request file or module


